    "input": "\"{\\\"message\\\": \\\"What is the average attack of all fire pokemon with defense lower 100? Search for type 1 and type 2\\\"}\"",
    "output": "\"Thank you for your question, young trainer! As Professor Oak, I've delegated this technical query to my specialized Tech Data Agent to perform the necessary calculations.\\n\\nAccording to my agent's analysis of the Pokémon database, the average attack of all Fire-type Pokémon (considering both primary and secondary types) with a defense stat lower than **100** is **84.66**.\\n\\nThis means that Fire Pokémon on the weaker defensive side tend to have a fairly respectable offensive power, which makes sense given their fiery nature! Is there anything else you'd like to know about Pokémon statistics?\"",
    "createdAt": "2026-04-04T21:29:28.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-04-04T21:29:31.956Z",
